1
00:00:00,926 --> 00:00:02,676
(Susan:)Stop trying to be
the cool dad;

2
00:00:02,678 --> 00:00:06,518
(Susan:)you have a shirt
with our cat's picture on it.

3
00:00:06,515 --> 00:00:08,985
(Wyatt:)Anyway, we're here, slugger.

4
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:14,650
(Howard:)That's great, now they
know where I live.

5
00:00:14,656 --> 00:00:15,906
(Raj:)What are you talking about?

6
00:00:15,908 --> 00:00:17,438
(Raj:)They've always known
where you live.

7
00:00:17,442 --> 00:00:18,612
(Bernadette:)Yeah, if you want to go
off the grid,

8
00:00:18,610 --> 00:00:20,330
(Bernadette:)you have to move out
of your mother's house.

9
00:00:22,164 --> 00:00:24,334
(Raj:)Can we take a moment
to discuss

10
00:00:24,333 --> 00:00:26,503
(Raj:)that I just lied
to the government for you?

11
00:00:26,501 --> 00:00:27,621
(Leonard:)Yeah.

12
00:00:27,619 --> 00:00:29,789
(Howard:)I would not have
done that for you.

13
00:00:30,923 --> 00:00:33,753
(Bernadette:)Howard, please just call
the man, see what he wants.

14
00:00:33,759 --> 00:00:35,679
(Howard:)All right, all right.

15
00:00:35,677 --> 00:00:37,127
(Sheldon:)Hey,

16
00:00:37,129 --> 00:00:39,179
(Raj:)make sure you tell him that
you weren't home when he came by

17
00:00:39,181 --> 00:00:41,181
(Raj:)and that your Indian friend
gave you the message

18
00:00:41,183 --> 00:00:43,853
(Raj:)the moment
you stepped through the door.

19
00:00:43,852 --> 00:00:47,472
(Howard:)Yes, hello.
Uh,

20
00:00:47,472 --> 00:00:50,562
(Howard:)this is Howard Wolowitz
for Colonel Richard Williams.

21
00:00:50,559 --> 00:00:52,229
(Raj:)Oh, I take it back,
don't mention me.

22
00:00:52,227 --> 00:00:55,317
(Howard:)Hi, Colonel Williams,
how can I help you?

23
00:00:55,314 --> 00:01:00,024
(Howard:)What? Oh, uh, yes,
he is from India.

